# Arty web demo — optional configuration
#
# The demo runs with NO configuration at all. That is deliberate: it is what
# makes it safe to deploy and hand to a parent as a URL.
#
# Set a key and the onboarding is understood by Claude instead of by the
# built-in rules. Without one, /api/understand returns { available: false } and
# the client falls back silently. Nothing breaks either way.
#
# The key stays server side. It is never sent to the browser.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# The SDK also accepts an auth token, if that is how you authenticate.
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=
